    {
        "name": "get-lead-stats-tool",
        "title": "Get Lead Stats Tool",
        "description": "Leads captured for a period: the total, the breakdown by status (new, contacted,\nqualified, converted, lost), how many have been contacted, and the conversion\nrate (leads per 100 conversations). Answers \"how many leads this month?\", \"what's\nmy lead conversion rate?\", \"how many leads still need contacting?\".",
